@fact bram.prefect
# en: A prefect of your own year, with a red sash, a ledger of demerits and a fondness for your name.
text [6bfca0] = 和你同年级的级长，系着红绶带，揣着一本记过簿，特别喜欢往上写你的名字。

@fact bram.father
# en: His father was head boy, and has told Bram all his life that he will never amount to anything.
text [414950] = 他父亲当年是男生学生会主席，一辈子都在告诉布拉姆他不会有出息。
# en: Become his rival, and stay one into your second year.
hint [3520b4] = 成为他的对手，并一直较劲到第二年。

@fact bram.hall_tax
# en: He once invented a "hall tax" for the east staircase.
text [67e9e9] = 他曾为东侧楼梯发明过一项“走廊税”。
# en: Cross his path in the Courtyard before you get on.
hint [5420ae] = 趁你们还不对付时，在庭院碰见他。

@fact bram.cheating
# en: You saw him cheat in an exam. He knows you saw.
text [2e1460] = 你看见他考试作弊。他知道你看见了。
# en: Seek him out in an exam month, Frostcall or Highsun.
hint [cd83f3] = 在考试月（霜唤月或盛阳月）去找他。

@fact bram.ally
# en: Under the sash, he will step between you and trouble. Then he tells you not to make it weird.
text [e7ac5a] = 在那条绶带底下，他会挡在你和麻烦之间。然后叫你别把气氛搞得奇怪。
# en: Be kind to him when he is at his lowest.
hint [755cdb] = 在他最低落的时候善待他。

@fact bram.portrait
# en: His father's portrait hangs in the corridor of head boys. Every visit, his father stops in front of it, and then looks at Bram.
text [f58601] = 他父亲的肖像挂在历届男生代表的走廊里。每次来访，他父亲都会在它面前停下，然后看向布拉姆。
# en: Once you know about his father, become his friend.
hint [c9b848] = 知道他父亲的事之后，和他交朋友。

@fact bram.rematch
# en: When he loses, he practises alone on the duelling green every evening for a month, and then asks for a rematch.
text [f1ee7c] = 他一输，就会每天晚上独自在决斗草坪上练一个月，然后要求再比一场。
# en: Stay his rival, and beat him in a duel.
hint [bdc5df] = 和他保持对手关系，并在决斗中赢他。

@fact bram.sir
# en: At home he says "sir" to his father and almost nothing else. Whenever Bram is home, his father inspects his boots, the way Bram inspects first-years.
text [c02f77] = 在家里，他对父亲除了“是，先生”几乎什么都不说。只要布拉姆在家，他父亲就检查他的靴子，就像布拉姆检查一年级生那样。
# en: Spend a break in the capital, and call at Hollis House.
hint [a226be] = 假期去王都，登门拜访霍利斯宅。

@fact bram.piano
# en: At home he plays the piano at noon, very precisely, because he was told to at six and never stopped. He would rather you hadn't heard.
text [ad413c] = 在家时，他中午弹钢琴，弹得一丝不苟，因为六岁时有人叫他学，从没人叫他停。他宁愿你没听见。
# en: Call at Hollis House at noon, on a break in the capital.
hint [c60b05] = 假期在王都时，中午去霍利斯宅。

@fact bram.hester
# en: His older sister Hester went to Thornwick against their father's wishes. Bram is the only one who still writes to her, and keeps her letters inside the demerit ledger.
text [85f4e4] = 他姐姐赫丝特违背父亲的意愿去了荆木学院。只有布拉姆还给她写信，还把她的信夹在记过簿里。
# en: Keep calling at Hollis House.
hint [506be8] = 常去霍利斯宅走动。
